<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Unibanco cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Unibanco cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it cut its rating for Brazil's Unibanco to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Adriana Lacombe cited the recent outperformance of the stock in Sao Paulo, the firm said in a Wednesday analysis.</p>
<p>-- Unibanco was unchanged at 33 reais in Sao Paulo trade.</p>
</text>
